# functions.rk — naming a piece of work and giving a result back

to double with n as a number:
    give back n * 2

to greet with who as text:
    say "Hello,"
    say who

to roll:
    say "rolling..."

say "Doubled:"
say double with 21

greet with "world"

roll

say "Add them:"
say double with 3 + double with 4
